OL,3,GNEWSAHistorical treasures packed up for
OL,4,Acastle works
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,300 historical objects have
OL,7,Fbeen removed from Walmer Castle ahead
OL,8,Fof a major conservation project.
OL,10,FEnglish Heritage said its collections
OL,11,Fteam spent four weeks packing and
OL,12,Fmoving items including furniture,
OL,13,Fbooks, artworks, ceramics, glass, and
OL,14,Fthe Duke of Wellington's bed, chair and
OL,15,Ffamous boots.
OL,17,FThe duke, described by English Heritage
OL,18,Fas victor at the Battle of Waterloo and
OL,19,F"fashion icon", gave his name to the
OL,20,Fhumble welly.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
