OL,3,GNEWSAHistorical treasures packed up for
OL,4,Acastle works
OL,5,
OL,6,FItems were removed from the castle
OL,7,Fahead of a project costing more than
OL,8,F#5.5m to repair the castle's ageing
OL,9,Froof and protect the historic building
OL,10,Ffor future generations. The work will
OL,11,Falso include repairs to windows, doors
OL,12,Fand other areas.
